ens":2021,"requests":6}}],"version":1},"findings":[{"block_threshold":0.7,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Record a one-line acknowledgement that the --require-live exit-code change (0 -> non-zero on zero live successes) is an intended contract change and confirm no consumer outside the continue-on-error CI job depends on the old exit-0 behavior.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5b","T5e"],"criteria":["T4"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.7,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["'Have the live selected-criteria loop return a success count so --require-live can fail when live execution was attempted but produced zero successful evaluations.'","Context notes CI 'uses ANTHROPIC/OPENAI credentials' and the job is 'continue-on-error', but the ticket's portability aim targets non-CI/Bedrock-only environments that are exactly the newly-affected consumers."],"finding":"The plan changes the exit-code contract: --require-live will now fail non-zero when live was attempted but every criterion errored, where it previously exited 0. Non-CI/portability consumers (the stated motivation for this ticket) may rely on the prior lenient behavior, and no back-out note or explicit acknowledgement of this contract change beyond CI is recorded.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f19f27683c532ba5b","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Plan bullet 3 / Acceptance Criteria (the --require-live decision)","norm_id":"ndfea0aa57d50b7d1","priority":0.0,"reason":"veto:absence-refuted","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A non-CI script invoking `criteria eval --changed-since --require-live` in a Bedrock-only env with no working creds now exits non-zero where it previously exited 0."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.375,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"no","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_